SUMMARY:Box of Joy Collection Week
DESCRIPTION:Box Of Joy Gifts!\n **October 5th through November 15th**\nBox
  Of Joy is a Cross Catholic outreach\, whose mission it is to shop for an
 d send Christmas gifts to children in the most impoverished countries of 
 the world such as Honduras\, Guatemala\, Nicaragua\, and Peru.\nJoin us f
 or this fun and heartwarming mission!\nGift boxes and shopping suggestion
 s will be available in parishes throughout the diocese beginning October 
 5th. Packed gift boxes are due back for our Box Of Joy Collection Week \,
  November 9 through the 15th. \nParishes currently participating in this 
 year’s box of joy program are as follows:\nSaint Anthony – St. Cloud\nSai
 nt Charles – Herman\nSaint Columbkille – Avon\nSt. Mary’s – Upsala\nSaint
  Margaret – Paynesville\nSaint Michael – Buckman\nSaint Joseph – Pierz\nS
 acred Heart – Sauk Rapids\nAnnunciation – Mayhew Lake\nSaint Francis Xavi
 er – Sartell\nSaint Stephen – Saint Stephen\n\nSaint Joseph’s church in P
 ierz Minnesota serves as our diocese drop center! For more information co
 ntact Sara Stumpf at 320-555-0100 (parish office) or 320-555-0100.
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/box-of-joy-collection-week/
LOCATION:MN
CATEGORIES:Parish Events
END:VEVENT
