SUMMARY:Toys for Tots Collection — St. Cloud\, Catholic Charities
DESCRIPTION:Emergency Services is accepting toy donations Monday through F
 riday during regular business hours at the loading area of 157 Roosevelt 
 Road\, Suite 100\, St. Cloud\, Door D (back of building). Please do not l
 eave donations outside our doors\, as they must be collected by Catholic 
 Charities staff. \nFor more information about drop-off locations\, donati
 ons and volunteering\, visit the St. Cloud Area Toys for Tots webpage at 
 st-cloud-mn.toysfortots.org. \nOnline registration for the U.S. Marine Co
 rps Reserve Toys for Tots Campaign is now open and will remain available 
 through December 5\, 2025\, at 11:45 pm. For details on registration\, di
 stribution dates\, donating\, or volunteering with the St. Cloud Area Toy
 s for Tots program\, visit ccstcloud.org/toysfortots \nAbout the Marine C
 orps Reserve Toys for Tots Program\nToys for Tots\, a 77-year national ch
 aritable program run by the U.S. Marine Corps Reserve\, provides happines
 s and hope to less fortunate children during each Christmas holiday seaso
 n. The toys\, books and other gifts collected and distributed by Marines 
 and volunteers offer these children recognition\, confidence and a positi
 ve memory for a lifetime. We believe it is such experiences that help dis
 advantaged children become responsible citizens and caring members of the
 ir community. For more information\, visit toysfortots.org. \nAbout Catho
 lic Charities Emergency Services\nCatholic Charities Emergency Services\,
  a program of Catholic Charities of the Diocese of St. Cloud\, works to p
 rovide food\, basic everyday essentials and financial assistance to those
  in need in our community. \nAbout Catholic Charities of the Diocese of S
 t. Cloud\nThe mission of Catholic Charities is to empower our neighbors a
 nd create impact in housing\, food\, and mental health that is seen and f
 elt for generations. Catholic Charities is an equal opportunity employer.
  Learn more at ccstcloud.org.
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/toys-for-tots-collection-st-cloud-catholic-charities/2026-11-13/
LOCATION:Catholic Charities – Emergency Services\, 157 Roosevelt Rd Ste 100\, St Cloud\, MN\, 56301
CATEGORIES:Parish Events
END:VEVENT
