SUMMARY:Our Sacred Universe Story — Little Falls\, Franciscan Center
DESCRIPTION:Little Falls\, MN – The Franciscan Sisters of Little Falls inv
 ite the community to join a new monthly series\, Our Sacred Universe Stor
 y\, beginning this January. This series is inspired by AM-U-NDO*\, a mini
 stry committed to exploring and integrating the ever-expanding love of ou
 r Universe story—a journey that unites modern scientific understanding wi
 th the sacredness of life. \nEach session will feature a thought-provokin
 g DVD presentation from renowned voices such as eco-theologian Thomas Ber
 ryand cosmologist Brian Swimme\, followed by a group reflection on insigh
 ts and questions. \nSchedule:\nThird Tuesday of each month\nAugust 18 | S
 eptember 15 | October 20 | November 17 | December 15 \nTime: 5:30–7:00 PM
 \nLocation: St. Francis Campus\, Room 144 \nNo RSVP is required. The even
 t is free of charge\, and donations are gratefully accepted. \nEvent Cont
 ent Inquiries:\nSister Shirley – FSLF Motherhouse\nTricia McMahon – 408.5
 07.7187 | contact@example.org \nEvent Logistics:\nKari Lamb – 320.632.068
 0 | contact@example.org \n* AM-U-NDO (pronounced “awm-u-endo”) is the col
 laborative ministry of Sister Shirley Mueller and Tricia J. McMahon\, ded
 icated to exploring and integrating the ever-expanding Love of our Univer
 se story.
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/our-sacred-universe-story-little-falls-franciscan-center/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:Franciscan Welcoming House\, 1600 11th Ave. S.\, St. Cloud\, MN\, 56301\, United States
CATEGORIES:Parish Events
GEO:45.5426263;-94.1635397
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Franciscan Welcoming House 1600 11th Ave. S. St. Cloud MN 56301 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1600 11th Ave. S.:geo:-94.1635397,45.5426263
END:VEVENT
