SUMMARY:Breakfast — Luxemburg\, St. Wendelin
DESCRIPTION:St. Anne’s Christian Women of Luxemburg (St. Wendelin’s Parish
 ) will be hosting their annual fundraiser breakfast on Sunday\, November 
 22\, 2026 at Mary Hall from 8:30 am to Noon.  The menu for this breakfast
  includes:  All You Care to Eat Pep’s Pork Sausage\, Ham\, Pancakes with 
 Toppings\, Scrambled Eggs\, Fresh Fruit\, Toast\, Rolls\, Juice\, Milk an
 d Coffee.  A Craft Sale\, Bake Sale and Raffle will also take place.  The
  price for the breakfast is:  Adults – $11.00\, Children (ages 5-10) – $5
 .00 and Children (under 5) – Free.  Sunday’s Mass at St. Wendelin’s is ce
 lebrated at 10:00 am.  We hope you will allow us to cook breakfast for yo
 u while you kick back and relax.  We would love to see you!
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/breakfast-luxemburg-st-wendelin/
LOCATION:St. Wendelin Parish – Luxemburg\, 22714 State Highway 15\, St. Cloud\, MN\, 56301\, United States
CATEGORIES:Parish Events
GEO:45.4515323;-94.2463623
