SUMMARY:Taizé Prayer — Little Falls\, Gathering Space
DESCRIPTION:Join the Franciscan Sisters of Little Falls for Taizé Prayer o
 n Tuesday\, November 24\, 5:30 p.m. in the Gathering Space on the campus 
 of the Franciscan Sisters. Enter at the Main Entrance\, Door F. All are w
 elcome! \nTaizé is a reflective and meditative prayer experience featurin
 g simple\, repetitively sung chants\, Scripture readings\, prayers\, and 
 contemplative silence. Taizé services\, loved across the globe\, are calm
 ing\, centering\, and worshipful; a perfect way to end a busy day. No exp
 erience with meditation\, or a singing voice\, needed! All are welcome. T
 he service lasts about 45 minutes and no RSVP is needed. \nFuture Taizé P
 rayer services will be held December 15\, 2026; and January 26\, February
  23\, March 30\, April 27\, and May 25\, 2027. For more information\, cal
 l 320.632.0680 or email contact@example.org.
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/taize-prayer-little-falls-gathering-space-3/
LOCATION:St. Francis Convent – Little Falls\, 116 8th Ave SE\, Little Falls\, MN\, 56345\, United States
CATEGORIES:Parish Events
GEO:45.9658516;-94.3627766
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=St. Francis Convent – Little Falls 116 8th Ave SE Little Falls MN 56345 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=116 8th Ave SE:geo:-94.3627766,45.9658516
END:VEVENT
