SUMMARY:Advent Sacred Pause — Virtual
DESCRIPTION:Advent Sacred Pause • Virtual\nGather to share common prayer o
 f lectio divina (prayerful reading) using the Gospels of the\nSundays of 
 Advent. Meet virtually with a sister spiritual companion for 30 minutes. 
 \nDates: Wednesdays\, December 2\, 9\, 16\, 23\nTimes: 11 a.m. to 12 p.m.
 \nFacilitators: Mary Catherine Holicky\, OSB\, and Eunice Antony\, OSB\nL
 imit: Minimum of 4\, maximum of 6 participants\nFee: $60\nRegistration cl
 oses Tuesday\, November 24.\nRegistration Link: https://sbm.osb.org/event
 /advent-sacred-pause-virtual/2026-12-02/
URL:https://thecentralminnesotacatholic.org/event/advent-sacred-pause-virtual-3/2026-12-02/
LOCATION:MN
CATEGORIES:Advent Prayer Services/Retreats,Parish Events
END:VEVENT
