SUMMARY:Advent Lessons and Carols — Little Falls\, Our Lady of Lourdes
DESCRIPTION:All are invited to join us for an Evening of Advent Lessons an
 d Carols; a service of Scripture and song\, being held at Our Lady of Lou
 rdes Catholic Church on Sunday\, December 6th at 6:30 pm.  Listen to Scri
 pture lessons which recount the Fall \, the promise of a Messiah\, and th
 e Incarnation.  Each lesson is followed by a prayer\, song or hymn that r
